  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Black Box — Cursed Technique Reversal, 3rd level</em></p><p>At 3rd level, you can spend up to twice your CE modifier in additional cursed energy to gain a weakening for every 2 CE spent.</p>\n<p><strong>Fragility.</strong> Your Cube loses 1 HP and gains a -1 to AC for every weakening and lasts an additional minute for every 2 weakenings.</p>\n<p><strong>Shatterability.</strong> Your box deals additional slashing damage equal to your CE modifier for every weakening.</p>\n<p><strong>Size.</strong> For every weakening, you can make your Glass Box 5 feet larger, allowing you to fit more creatures. (10 ft &lt; 15 ft &lt; 20ft)</p>",
